; Intentionally empty of scope overrides.
;
; The file used to pin @adobe to registry.npmjs.org, which is
; Zscaler-blocked on BAC machines and breaks `npm install` in the
; devcontainer. BAC devs pull @adobe via the JFrog mirror (configured
; in .devcontainer/.npmrc.jfrog). External contributors fall through
; to npm's default registry, which points at registry.npmjs.org
; anyway — no need for the committed file to force it.
